UPDATE companies SET description='Martin Bamberger Company operates from Baltimore, Maryland, tracing its roots to 1942 when Martin Bamberger opened a small shop supplying grocery stores. Three generations later, the business remains family-owned and operated, having grown from a local supplier into a multi-state distributor of commercial food service equipment.

