UPDATE companies SET description='Maxzone Auto Part Corp. was established in 1997 in Fontana, California, as the North American distribution arm of DEPO, a Taiwanese automotive lighting manufacturer founded in 1978 in Lukang, Taiwan. The company operates as an ISO‑certified distributor with four strategically placed warehouses across the United States.

The facilities support fast delivery throughout North America, backed by vehicle test‑fit protocols, scratch‑ and UV‑resistant lens coatings, and a one‑year limited warranty on select items.

