UPDATE companies SET description='Mectronx Corp operates from Oconomowoc, Wisconsin. The company''s founding year is not publicly disclosed, but it achieved ISO 9001:2015 certification on May 29, 2018. Steve Lechtenberg serves as president.

Mectronx is a contract manufacturer specializing in electronic assemblies, offering services from rapid PCB prototyping to full turnkey production. Its climate-controlled, ESD-compliant facility handles surface-mount and through-hole assembly, conformal coating, encapsulation, selective and wave soldering, robotic dispensing, plasma treatment, and functional testing. The shop supports prototypes and low-to-medium volume runs, processing thousands of part numbers daily with capabilities for up to 200 unique SMT BOM items and 1,000+ placements per board.

The company serves OEMs and design firms across industries including consumer electronics, energy, agriculture, construction, industrial equipment, and marine. Typical applications involve silicone keypads, power distribution, Bluetooth and cellular connectivity, GPS tracking, LED lighting, motor controllers, and sensor assemblies.

Mectronx emphasizes speed and transparency, advertising 3-day PCB turns and same-day manufacturing for prototypes, with a quoted defect rate of 153 parts per million. Its safety-stocking program secures long-lead components early in the design cycle, and the firm maintains that its ISO 9001:2015 system has been in place since its first year of operation.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly (SMT, through-hole)", "Mechanical assembly", "Conformal coating", "Encapsulation", "Selective soldering", "Wave soldering (lead-free)", "X-ray inspection", "Functional testing", "PCB programming", "Robotic dispensing (3 & 6 axis)", "Plasma surface treatment", "Laminar flow clean assembly", "Precision mechanical assembly", "PCB fabrication (rigid, rigid-flex, flex, 2-8 layers)", "Component sourcing and procurement", "Safety stocking/inventory management", "Design for manufacturability (DFM) review", "Panelization (V-score, mouse bites, pre-routed)", "Custom labeling (barcode, MAC address, serial numbers)", "Shipping (FOB Oconomowoc, UPS, FedEx, SpeeDee)"], "industries": ["Design & Engineering Firms", "Consumer Electronics", "Energy", "Agriculture", "Construction", "Industrial", "Marine"], "materials": ["FR4 (Ventec VT-42, VT-47 180TG)", "Copper (0.5-4 oz)", "ENIG surface finish", "Solder mask (green, red, blue, clear, black, white)", "Silkscreen (white, yellow, black)", "Silicone (keypads)", "PTFE (venting)", "Customer-specified encapsulation materials"], "equipment": ["SMT production lines", "Lead-free wave solder machine", "Selective solder machine", "X-ray inspection system", "Robotic dispensing systems (3-axis, 6-axis)", "Plasma surface treatment system", "Automated paste inspection (SPI)", "3D printers (external)", "CNC machining (external)", "Injection molding (external)"], "volume": "Prototype to low/medium volume production; no MOQ for rapid prototypes, 100-unit minimum for turnkey", "lead_time": "3-day PCB turns, same-day manufacturing for prototypes; 2-5 day fabrication turns; 1 business day average quote", "tolerances": "Trace/space down to 5/5 mil (0.5 oz copper), min finished hole size 0.008\"", "built_on": ["3-day PCB turns and same-day manufacturing for prototypes", "No minimum order quantity for rapid prototypes", "ISO 9001:2015 certified since first year of operation", "Defect rate of 153 PPM (below 500 PPM target)", "Safety-stocking program for critical components"], "facts_used": ["Location: Oconomowoc, WI -> db", "ISO 9001:2015 certification date: May 29, 2018 -> /", "President: Steve Lechtenberg -> /about-us", "Services: PCB assembly, mechanical assembly, conformal coating, encapsulation -> /services", "Industries served: Design & Engineering Firms, Consumer Electronics, Energy, Agriculture, Construction, Industrial, Marine -> /services", "Equipment: SMT lines, lead-free wave solder, selective solder, X-ray, robotic dispensing 3 & 6 axis, plasma treatment -> /services, /capabilities", "Materials: FR4 Ventec VT-42/VT-47 180TG, copper 0.5-4 oz, ENIG -> /capabilities", "Volume: prototypes to low/medium volume -> /about-us", "Lead time: 3-day PCB turns, same-day manufacturing, 2-5 day fabrication -> /, /capabilities", "Tolerances: trace/space 5/5 mil (0.5 oz), min hole 0.008\" -> /capabilities", "Min order: no MOQ rapid, 100 turnkey -> /services", "Defect rate: 153 PPM -> /services", "Safety stocking program -> /services", "Made in America claim -> /services", "Turnkey manufacturing -> /services", "DFM review -> /services", "Panelization options -> /capabilities", "Labeling options -> /capabilities", "Shipping FOB Oconomowoc -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Mectronx Corp Contract Manufacturer of precision electronics", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "No minimum order quantity for rapid prototypes; 100 units for turnkey PCB assembly", "export_compliance