UPDATE companies SET description='Medical Murray was founded in 1996 as a privately owned company in North Barrington, Illinois. The firm began by producing finished medical devices, components, and subassemblies for customers ranging from startups to large OEMs.

The company operates two facilities: a headquarters in North Barrington that houses R&D labs, an ISO/IEC 17025:2017 accredited testing laboratory, and Class 7 cleanrooms for pilot production; and a 45,000-square-foot manufacturing plant in nearby Lake Zurich equipped for cleanroom molding, braiding, coil winding, custom forming, assembly, packaging, and sterilization. Services span design, prototyping, testing, process validation, and full-scale production of catheters, implants, covered stents, bioabsorbable components, and delivery systems.

Medical Murray serves the medical device industry across vascular, gastrointestinal, urologic, aortic, structural heart, neurovascular, cardiovascular, peripheral vascular, orthopedic, and gastroenterology markets. Its customer base includes early-stage startups and established original equipment manufacturers seeking a single source for development, testing, and manufacturing.

The company emphasizes a collaborative, single-source model that integrates assembly, packaging, sterilization, and distribution. Its stated purpose centers on extending patient time with loved ones, devoting attention to customer success, and supporting employee growth, underpinned by core values of helpfulness, happiness, responsibility, trustworthiness, and clever problem-solving.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016','ISO/IEC 17025:2017','FDA Registered','FDA QSR 21 CFR Part 820','ISO 14644','ISO 14698']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medical device design and development", "Prototyping and bench testing", "Pilot production", "Process validation (IQ, OQ, PQ)", "Design verification and validation", "Catheter assembly", "Implant development and manufacturing", "Covered stent and frame fabrication", "Bioabsorbable component manufacturing", "Textile and sensor integration", "ePTFE implant production", "Catheter shaft extrusion", "Cleanroom molding", "Braiding", "Coil winding", "Custom forming", "Cleanroom assembly", "Packaging and sterilization", "Distribution", "ISO/IEC 17025:2017 accredited mechanical and dimensional testing", "Material testing", "Packaging testing", "Lot release testing and inspection", "Failure analysis and reliability testing"], "industries": ["Vascular", "Gastrointestinal", "Urologic", "Aortic", "Structural heart", "Neurovascular", "Cardiovascular", "Peripheral vascular", "Orthopedics", "Gastroenterology", "Urology", "Medical device development", "Medical device testing", "Medical device manufacturing"], "materials": ["ePTFE", "Bioabsorbable polymers", "Textiles", "Sensors", "Catheter shaft materials", "Covered stent frames"], "equipment": ["Molding machines", "Braiders", "Coil winders", "Custom-forming equipment", "Class 7 certified cleanrooms"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-source assembly, packaging, sterilization, and distribution", "ISO/IEC 17025:2017 accredited testing laboratory", "Class 