UPDATE companies SET description='Messer Truck and Van operates from Westbrook, Maine, tracing its roots to 1899 when Walter A. Messer opened a one-man blacksmith and ship-smithing shop on Union Street in Portland. The family-owned business, now in its fourth generation, began by forging wagons, sleighs, and ironwork for ships before pivoting to truck bodies as motor vehicles replaced horse-drawn transport.

Today the company designs, installs, and services custom upfits for trucks and vans, handling everything from initial engineering through in-house installation and final inspection. The shop also provides repair and warranty support for the products it installs.

Messer emphasizes craftsmanship, clear communication, and a crew-first approach, values reinforced by its community partnerships with organizations like Westbrook Regional Vocational Center and STEAM Cathedral. Leadership continuity—Jeffrey Messer, the founder’s great-grandson, also served as NTEA president in 2015—underscores the firm’s deep industry ties.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom truck and van upfitting", "Design and engineering", "In-house installation", "Quality inspection", "Fleet upfitting management", "Snow plow installation and service", "Crane installation", "Service body installation (aluminum and steel)", "Van shelving and racking installation", "Equipment repair and maintenance", "Warranty service"], "industries": ["Construction", "Transportation and logistics", "Industrial machinery", "Veterinary services", "Commercial fleets", "Snow and ice management"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["DURAMAG aluminum service bodies", "CM service bodies", "Galion dump bodies and hoists", "Adrian Steel shelving and racking", "Fisher plows"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 1899, now in fourth generation", "In-house design, installation, and inspection process for every upfit", "Partnerships with top OEM brands (e.g., DURAMAG, Adrian Steel, Fisher) for proven equipment", "Fleet-focused delivery with consistent specs across single units or full fleets", "Community-invested with local partnerships in Maine and Ohio"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1899 by Walter A. Messer in Portland, Maine -> /about-us", "Family-owned, fourth generation, currently led by Jeffrey Messer -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Westbrook, Maine -> db", "Custom upfitting design, installation, inspection process -> /", "Fleet solutions for small to large commercial fleets -> /", "Partnerships with OEM brands (DURAMAG, Adrian Steel, Fisher, Galion) -> /, /about-us", "Community partnerships (Westbrook Regional Vocat