UPDATE companies SET description='Metal Masters Inc. was founded in 1973 by Wayne McCullough in Newberry, South Carolina. The company remains under his ownership and operates as a metalwork, welding, mechanical services, and fabrication contractor serving the Southeast.

The shop provides precision machining, CNC and CAD/CAM-based fabrication, welding, process piping, pipe installation, millwright services, maintenance, erection, equipment installation and relocation, and powder coating. It stocks a range of metals from thin gauge to thick plate, tubing, and solid stock, allowing it to begin most orders within 24 to 48 hours.

Metal Masters serves commercial, industrial, and residential customers across North Carolina, South Carolina, and Georgia. Its clients include businesses needing equipment repair or custom fabrication as well as homeowners requiring property modifications.

The company emphasizes efficiency, accuracy, and budget adherence, leveraging modern CNC and CAD/CAM technology to deliver drawings, quotations, and prototypes quickly. Its team of specialists — including a machine shop foreman, fabrication foreman, field superintendents, and a powder coat supervisor — supports a focus on quality tooling and rapid response.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC machining", "CAD/CAM", "Precision machining", "Fabrication", "Process piping", "Pipe installation", "Welding", "Millwright services", "Maintenance", "Erection", "Equipment installation", "Equipment relocation", "Powder coating"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Commercial", "Residential"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "24-48 hours to begin order", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Orders typically started within 24\u201348 hours using on-site material stock", "Integrated CNC and CAD/CAM workflow for machining and fabrication", "Full-service capabilities from precision machining to powder coating under one roof", "Rapid quoting, drawings, and prototyping turnaround"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1973 by Wayne McCullough -> /about", "Headquarters in Newberry, SC -> db", "Services: precision machining, fabrication, welding, millwright, maintenance, erection, equipment installation/relocation, powder coating -> /", "Materials on-site: thin gauge to thick plate, tubing, solid stock -> /", "Order start within 24-48 hours -> /", "Team includes owner, general manager, project manager, engineer, foremen, superintendents -> /about", "Serves businesses and homeowners in NC, SC, GA -> description", "Emphasis on efficiency, accuracy, budget, CNC/CAD/CAM technology -> /", "Quick response with drawings, quotations, prototypes -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Metal Masters, Inc. is a leading metalwork, welding, mechanical services, and fabrication contractor located in