UPDATE companies SET description='Meyers Auto Inc. has operated from Aberdeen, South Dakota since 1962. The business began as a local auto recycler serving the greater Aberdeen area, offering recycled automotive parts at affordable prices.

The company functions as an auto recycler and parts supplier, maintaining an up-to-date inventory searchable through the Car-Part Interchange system. It specializes in parts for all makes and models from model year 2000 onward, including cars and four-wheel-drive vehicles, and also purchases late-model wrecked vehicles for dismantling. A standard 90-day warranty covers all parts, with extended warranty options available.

Its customer base includes anyone seeking recycled replacement components such as wiring harnesses, bumper assemblies, differential units, and emissions-related parts. The company also buys wrecked late-model vehicles from sellers looking to dispose of damaged cars.

The business highlights its status as a Certified Member of the Automotive Recyclers Association (ARA) and its long-standing presence in the region as key differentiators. It emphasizes an always-current inventory, multi-part search capability, and the ability to source hard-to-find items on request.', certifications=ARRAY['Certified Member ARA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto parts recycling", "Recycled auto parts sales", "Vehicle acquisition (late-model wrecked)", "Parts inventory management (Car-Part Interchange)", "Warranty coverage (90-day standard)", "Extended warranty options", "Multi-part search", "Search by image"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Certified Member of the Automotive Recyclers Association (ARA)", "Standard 90-day warranty on all parts with extended options", "Specializes in all makes and models from 2000 onward", "Purchases late-model wrecked vehicles for recycling", "Real-time inventory via Car-Part Interchange system"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1962 -> db and homepage", "Headquarters in Aberdeen, South Dakota -> db and homepage", "Certified Member ARA -> homepage", "Standard 90-day warranty -> homepage", "Extended warranties available -> homepage", "Specializes in all makes and models from 2000 onward -> homepage", "Buys late-model wrecked vehicles -> homepage", "Uses Car-Part Interchange system -> capabilities (db)", "Offers multi-part search and search by image -> homepage", "Serves greater Aberdeen area and South Dakota -> homepage"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Since 1962, Meyers Auto has provided the greater Aberdeen area with high quality recycled auto parts at affordable rates.", "founded_year": "1962", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='meyers-au