UPDATE companies SET description='Michigan Chair Company, located in Howard City, Michigan, has been producing custom steam-bent hardwood components since 1946.

The company specializes in steam bending solid hardwoods to customer specifications, drying parts to 6–8% moisture content per Wood Component Manufacturers Association standards and adjusting shapes before shipment. It works with species including white ash, cherry, hard maple, soft maple, poplar, red oak, and walnut, accepting CAD data for quoting and production. No facility size or headcount figures are published.

Michigan Chair serves residential and contract furniture manufacturers, ranging from large multinational corporations to single-person studio furniture makers. Its bent parts address short-grain strength issues and allow designers to reduce joints and glue lines in high-end furniture.

The company emphasizes on-time delivery to agreed dates, honest evaluations of whether steam bending suits a given application, and fast turnaround. It positions its process as a way to eliminate the cracking and movement associated with glued-up curved panels.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Steam bending", "Custom hardwood bending", "Moisture content drying (6-8%)", "Shape adjustment to specification", "CAD file acceptance", "Species selection consultation", "Short grain strength solutions"], "industries": ["Residential furniture manufacturing", "Contract furniture manufacturing", "Studio furniture making"], "materials": ["White Ash", "Cherry", "Hard Maple", "Soft Maple", "Poplar", "Red Oak", "Walnut"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Delivers by agreed-upon due date", "Dries bends to 6\u20138% moisture content per WCMA standards", "Adjusts shape to customer specifications before shipping", "Provides honest evaluation of steam bending suitability", "Fast turnaround time"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946, Howard City, Michigan -> db", "Custom solid hardwood steam bending company -> /", "Serves residential and contract furniture manufacturers -> /", "Customers range from large multinationals to single-person studios -> /", "Dries bends to 6-8% moisture content per WCMA -> /", "Adjusts shape to match specs before shipping -> /", "Offers honest evaluation of bending suitability -> /", "Fast turnaround time claimed -> /", "Works with species: White Ash, Cherry, Hard Maple, Soft Maple, Poplar, Red Oak, Walnut -> /", "Accepts CAD data at  -> /", "Contact persons Tim or Bob -> /", "Historical catalogs from 1924, 1926, 1930 -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Michigan Chair Company is a custom solid hardwood steam bending company marketing to both residential and contract furniture manufacturers.", "founded_year": "1946", "employee_